# Midnight Arcade: an original for the Synthwave style, redone around its saw lead and melody. The
# hook opens the song bare, the verses keep the arp out of the melody's way and a counter-line answers
# under it, the choruses double the melody an octave down over a bass that ducks the sub on every kick,
# and the breakdown and the outro leave the melody alone with a dotted-eighth delay. A sixteen-bar solo
# takes the verse changes with ghost-noted drums under it. The D chord is open fifths wherever the
# melody's passing G or a solo bend might fight a third.
title: Midnight Arcade
composer: Claude, MiMo v2.6 Pro & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: synthwave
key: E minor
tempo: 98
time: 4/4

